SUMMARY:Ravi Coltrane Quartet: Centennial Celebration
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. Saxophonist Ravi Coltrane — son of John Coltrane and Alice Coltrane — leads his quartet in a set marking the 100th anniversary of his father's birth in 1926\, one of several Coltrane centennial tributes across the weekend.
